- <a href="#l1-book-front" | `<book-front>`>, <a href="#l1-book-body" | `<book-body>`>, <a href="#l1-book-back" | `<book-back>`> — structural regions.
- <a href="#l1-meta" | `<meta>`> — the metadata container used inside book-parts (and articles, books).
- <a href="#l1-book-part-title" | `<book-part-title>`> — title element for a book-part, promoted from `<title>` in `<meta>`.

