*No kwargs or boolean flags.*

The sub sub section title of a `<sub-sub-section>`. Auto-generated by the structural plugin from the pipe-content of `<sub-sub-section | ...>` (title extraction); an explicit-form escape hatch exists but is not the authoring path.

